## Open Source Acknowledgements

This repository's CI pipeline is built on the following open-source projects:

- **[GitHub Actions](https://docs.github.com/en/actions)** — workflow runner and CI/CD automation
- **[actions/checkout](https://github.com/actions/checkout)** — repository checkout action
- **[actions/setup-java](https://github.com/actions/setup-java)** — JDK setup and Gradle caching
- **[actions/cache](https://github.com/actions/cache)** — build artifact and submodule caching
- **[GitHub CLI (gh)](https://cli.github.com/)** — release and asset management
- **[Eclipse Temurin](https://adoptium.net/temurin/)** — OpenJDK 21 distribution
- **[Android SDK Build-Tools](https://developer.android.com/tools/releases/build-tools)** — APK packaging and signing (apksigner)
- **[Python](https://www.python.org/)** — stale cache cleanup scripting

The built application itself (source in a separate private repository) also depends on numerous open-source libraries, whose attributions are bundled within each release APK.

